<title>FRANCE: Morocco seeks 20,000 tonnes durum wheat - traders.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks 20,000 tonnes durum wheat - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco is in the market this week to import 20,000 tonnes of U.S. or Canadian durum wheat or any combination of the two, for delivery in late January-early February, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Traders said they expected Morocco to tender for the wheat later on Monday or on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
